  "content": "\n\n<p>这是我为 PopularMMOS 制作的幸运方块竞速地图。<br>它包含自定义幸运方块！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>一路破坏幸运方块，竞速前往地图终点。</p>\n<p>最先到达终点者获胜。</p>\n<p>当双方都到达终点后，可以一决高下。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>沿途设有检查点。</p>\n<p><br>银行/起始资金<br><img src=\"https://jtrent238.weebly.com/uploads/3/7/1/0/37102619/ss-2016-08-03-at-09-01-11_orig.png\" width=\"343\" height=\"165\"><br>或<br><img src=\"https://jtrent238.weebly.com/uploads/3/7/1/0/37102619/ss-2016-08-03-at-09-03-03-1.png?399\" width=\"399\" height=\"138\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\">注意：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\">您必须手动安装幸运方块模组</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#f00\">您还需要用这些文件替换幸运方块 .jar 包中的文件&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/epicproportions-lucky-block\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/epicproportions-lucky-block</a></p>",
